process, he meets many characters from classic Disney films and from the Final Fantasy video game series.", "summary": "Originally released only in Japan on December 26, 2002, Kingdom Hearts Final Mix is finally brought to the global scene as an HD Remaster in the collection \"Kingdom Hearts HD 1.5 ReMIX\". It has several events and a number of gameplay tweaks that are not in previous releases. New scenes, clarifying certain plot points, such as Riku's journey and foreshadowing of Kingdom Hearts II, were included, but no new dialogue was recorded. A gameplay option allows the player to skip cutscenes. The optional bosses are included, along with a new fight against \"Unknown Man.\"", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/kingdom-hearts-final-mix--1", "videos": [{"id": 72994, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Wv0zANnJiVk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Wv0zANnJiVk", "title": "KINGDOM HEARTS HD 1.5 + 2.5 ReMIX \u2013 Announce Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Wv0zANnJiVk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 72995, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "WoTFkF88rKs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WoTFkF88rKs", "title": "KINGDOM HEARTS HD 1.5 + 2.5 Remix - Fight the Darkness Trailer | PS4", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WoTFkF88rKs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 121263, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "iOVVakmqQcE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iOVVakmqQcE", "title": "Kingdom Hearts HD 1.5 Remix Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/iOVVakmqQcE/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 272, "name": "Kingdom Hearts"}]}